Firstly, there's no way that the book can be destroyed, unless there's a bug
which I haven't heard of. It certainly can't be faded by dipping in water.

Of course I don't know where it is, but can I suggest that you try looking in
some of the pools around the Wiz's level. If you killed the Wiz when he was
over one of these, all his possesions will have sunk into the mire. Caught me
the first time. There are lots of ways to get things out of pools.

- Wand of fire
- Polymorph into a water breathing monster, remember to drop scrolls etc!
- Amulet of magical breathing (as above)

Any others?

